# INVWINSW.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:SPLIT20.CFG (TEST/WIN/SPLIT20.CFG, WINSPLIT=20): the tree of the
# split view twenty average characters wide.  Box B2 selected, the frame
# maximized and restored keeps it selected beside its contents, and the
# width.  The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINSW.SNP is its
# snapshot; TEST/splitchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
K DOWN DOWN
S B2
K ALT-SPACE X
S MAX
K ALT-SPACE R
S RESTORE
K ALT-F X
